  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, mash chickpeas using a fork or a potato masher.",
    "Add yellow onion, spicy red pepper, garlic, cumin, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper to the bowl with the chickpeas.",
    "Stir in falafel mix and lemon juice until well combined.",
    "Using your hands, shape the mixture into 8-10 patties.",
    "Brush grill with oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the falafel patties for 4-5 minutes per side, or until golden brown and crispy.",
    "Serve hot with your favorite sides, such as pita bread, salad, or rice."
